error[SC0107]: a trigraph splice in a comment is not supported
   ╭─[ a_trigraph_splice_in_a_comment_is_refused.c:2:16 ]
   │
 2 │     // another ??/
   │                ─┬─  
   │                 ╰─── this joins the next line to the comment in C17
───╯
  = note: clang's and gcc's default modes do not read trigraphs, so the comment would end here when built with them
